# Request Options & Cookies

The two remaining REST tables not covered elsewhere in this repo: `options-table` (request-level behavior flags) and `cookies-table` (outbound cookies).

```void
---
type: request-separator
attrs:
  uid: "3d81d2b6-091e-4836-b085-2c9e6e882c0c"
  colorIndex: 0
  label: "Redirect Handling (options-table)"
---
```

`follow_redirects: false` means we should see httpbin's own 302 instead of the page it redirects to.

```void
